	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Express Entry in 2026: A Practical Guide]]></title>
		<link>https://example.com/express-entry-in-2026-a-practical-guide/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=2015</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Skilled-migration programmes reward preparation. Start by confirming language test results, education assessment and proof of funds, because these take the longest to obtain.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Next, build a document checklist that matches the programme you are targeting. Missing or inconsistent paperwork is the most common cause of delays.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Finally, review your profile every quarter. Rules and invitation thresholds change, and a small improvement in score can move you into the next draw.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
