	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Student Visa Interview: What Officers Really Ask]]></title>
		<link>https://example.com/student-visa-interview-what-officers-really-ask/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=2016</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Interview officers want to confirm three things: that you are a genuine student, that you can fund your studies and that you intend to follow the rules.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Practise explaining why you chose your course and country in your own words, and bring original documents in the order they will be asked for.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
